{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108512","id":2658404824,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6edAnY","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108512","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108512.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108512.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108512","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108512/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108512/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108512/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/51f6f5af90d0d34db73f7bd19fb0cc8e0ca1f118","number":108512,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add svg import conversion tool","user":{"login":"mlm-games","id":125530737,"node_id":"U_kgDOB3tycQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125530737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlm-games","html_url":"https://github.com/mlm-games","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlm-games/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlm-games/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlm-games/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlm-games/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlm-games/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlm-games/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlm-games/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlm-games/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlm-games/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes [godotengine/godot-proposals#12770](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12770).\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new tool to the Project > Tools menu (currently titled: \"Convert SVG Import Files from Texture2D to SVGTexture\") . When run, it finds all of the svg files in the project and converts their importer to SVGTexture from Texture2D, causing the oversampling feature work for them. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"773\" height=\"269\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b97c1645-b8ce-4666-8798-10092a18a6b5\" />\r\n\r\nHere is an adapted project where i had imported the editor icons used in the main scene to Texture2D\r\n[adapted_test_project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21179260/adapted_test_project.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\nThe code in this PR is adapted from the \"Upgrade Project Files...\" tool (ProjectUpgradeTool in the source code, and the pr format has been adapted from the [Add UID upgrade tool PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102071) ).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n> Had initially thought of doing this for my project which had a lot of svg files that were still imported as CompressedTexture2Ds in 4.5-beta3 (makes sense, if using custom import settings that can't be used currently and do not want them being erased). I didn't have any such import settings so thought of making an tool that helps with the conversion...\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at"